  "description": "21-Speed Shimano Gear System for Any Terrain - Ride freely through city streets or mountain trails with the 21-speed professional gearset, offering precise control and seamless shifting. Whether you're climbing, descending, or cruising, this E-MTB ensures a smooth and adaptable ride\n\nPowerful 1200W Peak Motor with 4 Riding Modes - This electric mountain bike for adults features a peak 1200W high-speed brushless motor, reaching up to 28MPH. Choose from manual, pedal-assist, throttle, or walk mode to suit different terrains — perfect for commuting, sightseeing, or fitness rides.\n\nRemovable 48V Battery – TUV Certified & Long-Range - Go further with a 48V 10.4Ah TUV-certified lithium battery, offering up to 55 miles per charge (PAS) or 40 miles on throttle mode. Waterproof, anti-theft, and secured with a lock and key, the battery charges in just 4 hours, ideal for home or office charging.\n\nSmart Safety – Dual Suspension & NFC Unlock - Enjoy every ride with confidence thanks to dual front suspension, 27.5” x 2.1” tires, and a lightweight frame for stable handling. The bright front headlight, rear reflector, and LCD display keep you informed and visible. Plus, the NFC smart card unlock system adds modern security and convenience — tap and ride, no password required.",
